BUSINESS REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (BRD)
Project Name
B2B Marketplace Platform 
________________________________________
1. Executive Summary
The purpose of this project is to develop a web-based B2B marketplace platform that connects buyers and suppliers/manufacturers across multiple industries.
The platform will allow businesses to:
•	Register their companies
•	Create business profiles
•	Upload and manage product catalogs
•	Receive buyer inquiries
•	Generate quotations
•	Manage leads
•	Communicate with buyers
•	Purchase premium subscriptions
The platform will act as a marketplace facilitator and lead-generation platform rather than directly selling products.
________________________________________
2. Business Objectives
The primary business objectives are:
•	Create a digital marketplace connecting suppliers and buyers.
•	Help businesses generate leads.
•	Enable suppliers to advertise products.
•	Generate revenue through subscriptions and advertisements.
•	Build a trusted supplier ecosystem.
•	Reduce traditional sourcing costs.
________________________________________
3. Problem Statement
Current problems in B2B trade include:
•	Buyers struggle to find verified suppliers.
•	Suppliers have limited marketing reach.
•	Product discovery is fragmented.
•	Quotation management is manual.
•	Business communication is inefficient.
•	Small businesses lack online presence.
The proposed system solves these problems through a centralized B2B marketplace.
________________________________________
4. Stakeholders
Stakeholder	Responsibility
Business Owner	Defines business goals
Admin Team	Platform management
Suppliers	Product listing
Buyers	Product sourcing
Developers	System development
Customer Support	User assistance
