5. User Roles
Super Admin
•	Manage entire platform
•	Verify suppliers
•	Manage subscriptions
•	View analytics
•	Manage categories
•	Manage advertisements
Supplier
•	Register business
•	Create company profile
•	Upload products
•	Receive inquiries
•	Send quotations
